 class="hub-card-d">Great journeys on a turning globe, one stop at a time: Alexander, Xuanzang, Ibn Battuta, Zheng He, Magellan and more.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/connections"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/congress-of-berlin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">11,383 links</span><span class="hub-card-t">Connections</span><span class="hub-card-d">Who succeeded, conquered, ruled or merged with whom: the states as one network.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/explorer"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pax-romana.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Rise and fall charts</span><span class="hub-card-t">Power Curves</span><span class="hub-card-d">Compare the rise and fall of 556 states and empires on one timeline.</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
